    "merchant-workflow-reports": "Compare original workflow runs, retain complete reports and receive their saved native history",
    "merchant-workflow-series-agent-receive": "Continue the complete original recurring customer through Merchant agent tools, review the native first call, and receive every customer file on a fresh Console"
  },
